# Generated web demo outputs — rebuilt by `pnpm run build:web` from
# `site-template.html` (pages + web.css) and `wallet.js` (the bundle).
# They used to be committed; the build is byte-identical, so keeping them in
# git only hid source changes behind regenerated noise.
